1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,800
Agar tumhari pehli WordCamp hai, toh yeh video dekh lo.

2
00:00:02,800 --> 00:00:05,400
Kisi ko jaante nahi, samajh nahi aata baat kaise shuru karein.

3
00:00:05,400 --> 00:00:08,000
Aur 'Contributor Day' ka matlab bhi pata nahi hota.

4
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:10,800
Isiliye hai CampBuddy — tumhara digital saathi.

5
00:00:10,800 --> 00:00:13,600
Home screen batata hai abhi kya karna chahiye — sab ek jagah.

6
00:00:13,600 --> 00:00:16,400
Ek simple checklist milti hai, chhoti chhoti cheezein karne ko.

7
00:00:16,400 --> 00:00:19,200
Apna digital Camp Card banao — naam aur kaam sab ek jagah.

8
00:00:19,200 --> 00:00:22,000
Koi account nahi, koi signup nahi — bas phone kholo aur shuru ho jao.

9
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:25,200
campbuddy.club pe jaake abhi try karo — bilkul free hai.
